    - rid: 4304780615459536923
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: intro
        speakerName: You
        text: The crevasse walls glow faintly with exposed ore. Goblin miners swarm a crude blockade, picks in hand, with a hulking Hobgoblin Overseer barking orders over the din.
        nextNodeId: check
    - rid: 4304780615459536924
      type: {class: CheckNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: check
        queryKey: Skill:Athletics
        difficultyClass: 14
        performer: 1
        successNodeId: success-line
        failureNodeId: failure-line
    - rid: 4304780615459536925
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: success-line
        speakerName: You
        text: You barrel through the blockade, scattering goblins and toppling the Overseer into his own tunnel. The vein is clear.
        nextNodeId: clear-action
    - rid: 4304780615459536926
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: failure-line
        speakerName: You
        text: The Overseer rallies his miners and drives you back up the passage, bruised but unbowed. You'll need another approach.
        nextNodeId: end
    - rid: 4304780615459536927
      type: {class: ActionNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: clear-action
        action:
          rid: 4304780615459536930
        nextNodeId: end
    - rid: 4304780615459536928
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: already-cleared
        speakerName: You
        text: The crevasse sits silent, the ore vein finally unguarded.
        nextNodeId: end
